      "content": "idk i dont think its just the wifi. it literally only happens when i'm talking about sensitive stuff or when i'm in a private call. and it's not just a random flicker, it feels like a pattern. like it's a code or something. do you think it's possible for these things to use the light frequency to transmit data or record audio in ways the manual doesnt mention?",
